# Dogfood: the public Flowthru skills (umbrella `flowthru` + per-package shards
# flowthru-<ext> / flowthru-funit) are INSTALLED here from their co-located
# sources at src/{extensions,core}/<Pkg>/skill/ via `npx skills add .` (see
# scripts/install-skills.sh). They are install artifacts, not source — never
# commit them; edit the source under src/ and regenerate/reinstall.
#
# flowthru-contributing is this repo's own agent-dev skill and stays committed
# (the SessionStart hook loads it), so it is re-included below.
/flowthru/
/flowthru-*/
!/flowthru-contributing/
